<title>JAPAN: IBJ denies report of CB issue in Switzerland.</title>
<headline>IBJ denies report of CB issue in Switzerland.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Bank of Japan Ltd (IBJ) on Tuesday denied a report by the International Financing Review (IFR) that it was considering launching a convertible bond issue in Switzerland.</p>
<p>&quot;We deny the IFR report as totally groundless. We have no such plans,&quot; a spokesman for IBJ said.</p>
<p>The financial weekly reported in its November 30 edition that there was a rumour that IBJ &quot;may launch sizeable issues in Switzerland&quot;.</p>
</text>
